# Paths that `git archive` leaves out of an archive of this repository.
#
# `export-ignore` affects only `git archive`. A listed file that exists is tracked, reviewed and
# kept in history like any other. Apart from `.DS_Store` files, which are junk, the paths below
# are not in this repository.

# A process checklist.
docs/pre-publication-checklist.md export-ignore

# Deployment notes.
docs/site-deployment.md export-ignore

# A maintenance script and its test.
scripts/collect-identifiers.mjs export-ignore
scripts/collect-identifiers.test.mjs export-ignore

# Working plans, which by the owner's rule (2026-10-25) are not kept in this repository. The
# requirements and design docs are.
docs/superpowers/** export-ignore
docs/superpowers/.DS_Store export-ignore

# Editor and OS junk.
**/.DS_Store export-ignore
